          "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>街角修鞋配钥匙 · 今天开门</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --red: #C1121F;\n      --paper: #EFE7D7;\n      --ink: #1A1614;\n      --lead: #6E6A5E;\n      --gutter: 24px;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', 'Source Han Sans SC';\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n    }\n    a { color: inherit; }\n    .page { min-height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n    .page::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 0;\n      top: -18vh;\n      left: 38%;\n      width: 27%;\n      height: 145vh;\n      background: var(--red);\n      transform: rotate(11deg);\n      transform-origin: center;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .masthead, .main-grid, .footer { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n    .masthead {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.45fr 0.7fr 0.9fr;\n      column-gap: var(--gutter);\n      align-items: end;\n      padding: 26px 5vw 18px;\n      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    }\n    .kicker {\n      color: var(--red);\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n    .masthead h1 {\n      grid-column: 1 / 3;\n      margin: 8px 0 0;\n      font-size: clamp(56px, 8.7vw, 96px);\n      line-height: .9;\n      letter-spacing: -.08em;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      max-width: 720px;\n    }\n    .masthead-note {\n      grid-column: 3 / 5;\n      align-self: end;\n      border-left: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      padding: 0 0 3px 16px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      max-width: 290px;\n    }\n    .masthead-note strong { color: var(--red); }\n    .main-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: .82fr 1.18fr .94fr 1.06fr;\n      gap: var(--gutter);\n      padding: 0 5vw;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n    .col { min-width: 0; }\n    .col-1 { padding-top: 0; }\n    .missing-news {\n      height: 78px;\n      position: relative;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lead);\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .missing-news::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--lead);\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 37px;\n    }\n    .section-label {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: var(--red);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      padding: 4px 8px 3px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n    .intro {\n      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin-top: 12px;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .intro h2 {\n      font-size: 29px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n      letter-spacing: -.05em;\n    }\n    .intro p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }\n    .rule { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--lead); margin: 16px 0; }\n    .phone-link {\n      display: block;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      padding: 11px 10px 9px;\n      margin-top: 15px;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n    .phone-link span { display: block; color: var(--red); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n    .phone-link b { font-family: 'Martian Mono', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -.06em; }\n    .story {\n      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      padding-top: 9px;\n      margin-bottom: 21px;\n    }\n    .story-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; }\n    .story-no {\n      font-family: 'Martian Mono', monospace;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: var(--red);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .story h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.06em; }\n    .story p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 15px; }\n    .story em { color: var(--red); font-style: normal; font-weight: 800; }\n    .photo {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n      border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin: 9px 0 10px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      background: var(--lead);\n    }\n    .photo-wide { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }\n    .photo-tall { aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; }\n    .photo-square { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }\n    .index-block {\n      border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      padding: 12px;\n      min-height: 168px;\n      margin-bottom: 21px;\n    }\n    .index-block h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 25px; line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.06em; }\n    .index-block p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }\n    .index-block .tiny { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--lead); font-size: 12px; }\n    .meta {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--lead);\n      padding-top: 7px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--lead);\n    }\n    .meta b { font-family: 'Martian Mono', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink); }\n    .footer {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: var(--gutter);\n      margin: 2px 5vw 0;\n      padding: 12px 0 20px;\n      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .footer strong { color: var(--red); }\n    .footer .mono { font-family: 'Martian Mono', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-align: right; }\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\n      .page::after { left: 58%; width: 42%; top: 8vh; height: 88vh; }\n      .masthead { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; padding: 18px 18px 15px; }\n      .masthead h1 { grid-column: 1 / 3; font-size: 60px; margin-top: 12px; }\n      .masthead-note { grid-column: 1 / 3; margin-top: 15px; max-width: none; }\n      .main-grid { display: block; padding: 0 18px; }\n      .col { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n      .missing-news { height: 78px; }\n      .story { margin-bottom: 25px; }\n      .footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin: 0 18px; }\n      .footer .mono { text-align: left; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">街角现场 / 今日开门</div>\n      <div></div><div></div><div></div>\n      <h1>鞋底在说<br>别再拖了</h1>\n      <div class=\"masthead-note\"><strong>一通电话，</strong>把磨坏的鞋、断掉的钥匙和今天的时间，先摊到台面上。</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"main-grid\" aria-label=\"修鞋配钥匙服务条目\">\n      <div class=\"col col-1\">\n        <div class=\"missing-news\" aria-label=\"留白栏目\"></div>\n        <span class=\"section-label\">小店口供 / 01</span>\n        <div class=\"intro\">\n          <h2>门一开，街就有事。</h2>\n          <p>我们修鞋，也配钥匙。不是把东西弄得像新的一样，是让它今晚还能继续上班、回家、赶下一班车。</p>\n          <hr class=\"rule\">\n          <p><strong>不排队猜。</strong>直接打过来，说你要修什么、什么时候到。</p>\n          <a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:010-66778899\"><span>唯一行动 / 现在约</span><b>010-66778899</b></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col col-2\">\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\"><h3>鞋跟先投降</h3><span class=\"story-no\">02</span></div>\n          <img class=\"photo photo-wide\" src=\"images/占位-1.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" alt=\"正在修理的黑色皮鞋后跟\">\n          <p>鞋底开口、后跟打滑、线头乱跑？<em>带来，别让它继续拖。</em>我们先看伤口，再说怎么补。</p>\n          <div class=\"meta\"><span>修鞋 / 现场判断</span><b>02</b></div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\"><h3>一把钥匙的脾气</h3><span class=\"story-no\">03</span></div>\n          <p>旧钥匙转不动，不代表门要换。拿原钥匙来，或者把门的故事讲清楚，剩下的交给机器和手。</p>\n          <div class=\"meta\"><span>配钥匙 / 常见胚</span><b>03</b></div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col col-3\">\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\"><h3>别等雨来验货</h3><span class=\"story-no\">04</span></div>\n          <img class=\"photo photo-tall\" src=\"images/占位-2.jpg\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" alt=\"雨天门口的一双旧鞋\">\n          <p>防滑底、开胶、鞋面刮伤，都是小事，直到你站在水坑里。<em>今天说，今天排。</em></p>\n          <div class=\"meta\"><span>补底 / 粘合 / 加固</span><b>04</b></div>\n        </article>\n        <div class=\"index-block\" role=\"note\">\n          <h3>折角索引<br>先打，再来。</h3>\n          <p>报上你的名字、要修的东西、预计到店时间。三句话，够我们把台子腾出来。</p>\n          <p class=\"tiny\">不接在线排号，不让你在页面里迷路。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col col-4\">\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\"><h3>一把新钥匙<br>不该长得孤单</h3><span class=\"story-no\">05</span></div>\n          <img class=\"photo photo-square\" src=\"images/占位-3.jpg\" width=\"560\" height=\"560\" alt=\"摊在桌面上的钥匙与金属工具\">\n          <p>家门、车库、储物间，常用的那把可以多配一把。<em>少一次折返，多一晚踏实。</em></p>\n          <div class=\"meta\"><span>钥匙 / 多配一份</span><b>05</b></div>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\"><h3>鞋带还在，鞋也该在</h3><span class=\"story-no\">06</span></div>\n          <img class=\"photo photo-wide\" src=\"images/占位-4.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" alt=\"鞋店工作台上的鞋带和皮革边角料\">\n          <p>鞋带、鞋垫、边角补强，能换的先换，能救的别扔。来店前先打电话，<em>别让好东西提前退休。</em></p>\n          <div class=\"meta\"><span>小修 / 配件 / 加固</span><b>06</b></div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div><strong>街角修鞋配钥匙</strong><br>看得见的手艺，听得见的电话。</div>\n      <div>周一至周六 / 09:00—19:00<br>急事先说，别客气。</div>\n      <div>店在街口，不在云里<br>电话确认后再出发。</div>\n      <div class=\"mono\">版号 06<br>RED / INK / PAPER</div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
        }
      }
    }
