          "text": " <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>街角修鞋配钥匙 · 今天开门</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --red: #C1121F;\n      --paper: #EFE7D7;\n      --ink: #1A1614;\n      --lead: #6E6A5E;\n      --gutter: 24px;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: var(--paper);\n      color: var(--ink);\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: \"Noto Sans SC\", \"Source Han Sans SC\";\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n    }\n\n    a {\n      color: inherit;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .page::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 0;\n      top: -18vh;\n      left: 38%;\n      width: 27%;\n      height: 145vh;\n      background: var(--red);\n      transform: rotate(11deg);\n      transform-origin: center;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .masthead,\n    .main-grid,\n    .footer {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .masthead {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.45fr 0.7fr 0.9fr;\n      column-gap: var(--gutter);\n      align-items: end;\n      padding: 26px 5vw 18px;\n      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);\n    }\n\n    .kicker {\n      color: var(--red);\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .masthead h1 {\n      grid-column: 1 / 3;\n      margin: 8px 0 0;\n      max-width: 720px;\n      font-size: clamp(56px, 8.7vw, 96px);\n      line-height: 0.9;\n      letter-spacing: -0.08em;\n      font-weight: 900;\n    }\n\n    .masthead-note {\n      grid-column: 3 / 5;\n      align-self: end;\n      max-width: 290px;\n      border-left: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      padding: 0 0 3px 16px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .masthead-note strong {\n      color: var(--red);\n    }\n\n    .main-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 0.82fr 1.18fr 0.94fr 1.06fr;\n      gap: var(--gutter);\n      padding: 0 5vw;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n\n    .col {\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .col-1 {\n      padding-top: 0;\n    }\n\n    .missing-news {\n      height: 78px;\n      position: relative;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lead);\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .missing-news::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--lead);\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 37px;\n    }\n\n    .section-label {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: var(--red);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      padding: 4px 8px 3px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    }\n\n    .intro {\n      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin-top: 12px;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .intro h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      letter-spacing: -0.05em;\n    }\n\n    .intro p {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .rule {\n      border: 0;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--lead);\n      margin: 16px 0;\n    }\n\n    .phone-link {\n      display: block;\n      border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin-top: 15px;\n      padding: 11px 10px 9px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-weight: 900;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    .phone-link span {\n      display: block;\n      color: var(--red);\n      margin-bottom: 5px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .phone-link b {\n      font-family: \"Martian Mono\", monospace;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      letter-spacing: -0.06em;\n    }\n\n    .story {\n      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin-bottom: 21px;\n      padding-top: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .story-head {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: baseline;\n    }\n\n    .story-no {\n      color: var(--red);\n      font-family: \"Martian Mono\", monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .story h3 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      line-height: 1.02;\n      letter-spacing: -0.06em;\n    }\n\n    .story p {\n      margin: 8px 0 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .story em {\n      color: var(--red);\n      font-style: normal;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    .photo {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n      border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin: 9px 0 10px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      background: var(--lead);\n    }\n\n    .photo-wide {\n      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;\n    }\n\n    .photo-tall {\n      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;\n    }\n\n    .photo-square {\n      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n    }\n\n    .index-block {\n      min-height: 168px;\n      border: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      margin-bottom: 21px;\n      padding: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .index-block h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 25px;\n      line-height: 0.95;\n      letter-spacing: -0.06em;\n    }\n\n    .index-block p {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .index-block .tiny {\n      margin-top: 16px;\n      color: var(--lead);\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .meta {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--lead);\n      padding-top: 7px;\n      color: var(--lead);\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .meta b {\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: \"Martian Mono\", monospace;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: var(--gutter);\n      margin: 2px 5vw 0;\n      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);\n      padding: 12px 0 20px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .footer strong {\n      color: var(--red);\n    }\n\n    .footer .mono {\n      font-family: \"Martian Mono\", monospace;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n      text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\n      .page::after {\n        top: 8vh;\n        left: 58%;\n        width: 42%;\n        height: 88vh;\n      }\n\n      .masthead {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        padding: 18px 18px 15px;\n      }\n\n      .masthead h1 {\n        grid-column: 1 / 3;\n        margin-top: 12px;\n        font-size: 60px;\n      }\n\n      .masthead-note {\n        grid-column: 1 / 3;\n        max-width: none;\n        margin-top: 15px;\n      }\n\n      .main-grid {\n        display: block;\n        padding: 0 18px;\n      }\n\n      .col {\n        margin-bottom: 22px;\n      }\n\n      .missing-news {\n        height: 78px;\n      }\n\n      .story {\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n      }\n\n      .footer {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        margin: 0 18px;\n      }\n\n      .footer .mono {\n        text-align: left;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">街角现场 / 今日开门</div>\n      <div></div>\n      <div></div>\n      <div></div>\n\n      <h1>鞋底在说<br>别再拖了</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"masthead-note\">\n        <strong>一通电话，</strong>把磨坏的鞋、断掉的钥匙和今天的时间，先摊到台面上。\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"main-grid\" aria-label=\"修鞋配钥匙服务条目\">\n      <div class=\"col col-1\">\n        <div class=\"missing-news\" aria-label=\"留白栏目\"></div>\n\n        <span class=\"section-label\">小店口供 / 01</span>\n\n        <div class=\"intro\">\n          <h2>门一开，街就有事。</h2>\n          <p>\n            我们修鞋，也配钥匙。不是把东西弄得像新的一样，是让它今晚还能继续上班、回家、赶下一班车。\n          </p>\n\n          <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>不排队猜。</strong>直接打过来，说你要修什么、什么时候到。\n          </p>\n\n          <a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:010-66778899\">\n            <span>唯一行动 / 现在约</span>\n            <b>010-66778899</b>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col col-2\">\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\">\n            <h3>鞋跟先投降</h3>\n            <span class=\"story-no\">02</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <img\n            class=\"photo photo-wide\"\n            src=\"images/占位-1.jpg\"\n            width=\"640\"\n            height=\"480\"\n            alt=\"正在修理的黑色皮鞋后跟\"\n          >\n\n          <p>\n            鞋底开口、后跟打滑、线头乱跑？<em>带来，别让它继续拖。</em>我们先看伤口，再说怎么补。\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"meta\">\n            <span>修鞋 / 现场判断</span>\n            <b>02</b>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\">\n            <h3>一把钥匙的脾气</h3>\n            <span class=\"story-no\">03</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <p>\n            旧钥匙转不动，不代表门要换。拿原钥匙来，或者把门的故事讲清楚，剩下的交给机器和手。\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"meta\">\n            <span>配钥匙 / 常见胚</span>\n            <b>03</b>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col col-3\">\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\">\n            <h3>别等雨来验货</h3>\n            <span class=\"story-no\">04</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <img\n            class=\"photo photo-tall\"\n            src=\"images/占位-2.jpg\"\n            width=\"480\"\n            height=\"640\"\n            alt=\"雨天门口的一双旧鞋\"\n          >\n\n          <p>\n            防滑底、开胶、鞋面刮伤，都是小事，直到你站在水坑里。<em>今天说，今天排。</em>\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"meta\">\n            <span>补底 / 粘合 / 加固</span>\n            <b>04</b>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <div class=\"index-block\" role=\"note\">\n          <h3>折角索引<br>先打，再来。</h3>\n          <p>\n            报上你的名字、要修的东西、预计到店时间。三句话，够我们把台子腾出来。\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"tiny\">\n            不接在线排号，不让你在页面里迷路。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col col-4\">\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\">\n            <h3>一把新钥匙<br>不该长得孤单</h3>\n            <span class=\"story-no\">05</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <img\n            class=\"photo photo-square\"\n            src=\"images/占位-3.jpg\"\n            width=\"560\"\n            height=\"560\"\n            alt=\"摊在桌面上的钥匙与金属工具\"\n          >\n\n          <p>\n            家门、车库、储物间，常用的那把可以多配一把。<em>少一次折返，多一晚踏实。</em>\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"meta\">\n            <span>钥匙 / 多配一份</span>\n            <b>05</b>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"story\">\n          <div class=\"story-head\">\n            <h3>鞋带还在，鞋也该在</h3>\n            <span class=\"story-no\">06</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <img\n            class=\"photo photo-wide\"\n            src=\"images/占位-4.jpg\"\n            width=\"640\"\n            height=\"480\"\n            alt=\"鞋店工作台上的鞋带和皮革边角料\"\n          >\n\n          <p>\n            鞋带、鞋垫、边角补强，能换的先换，能救的别扔。来店前先打电话，<em>别让好东西提前退休。</em>\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"meta\">\n            <span>小修 / 配件 / 加固</span>\n            <b>06</b>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>街角修鞋配钥匙</strong><br>\n        看得见的手艺，听得见的电话。\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        周一至周六 / 09:00—19:00<br>\n        急事先说，别客气。\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        店在街口，不在云里<br>\n        电话确认后再出发。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mono\">\n        版号 06<br>\n        RED / INK / PAPER\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
        }
      }
    }
  },
